<title>USA: Oryx CFO Wilson leaves, replacement named.</title>
<headline>Oryx CFO Wilson leaves, replacement named.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oryx Technology Corp said Tuesday that Mitchel Underseth will replace Andrew Wilson as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Oryx said Wilson has left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
</text>
